  //
  // The ball is moved discretely (step() once per frame), so we re-sweep its
  // path since the previous position in radius-sized sub-steps. A short time
  // slice at a high level can otherwise clear a whole brick row without ever
  // touching it (tunnelling, see #1). brickBounce() resolves the face and
